<mjml lang="en" dir="ltr">
  <mj-head>
    <mj-include path="./partials/oortcloud-head.mjml" />
    <mj-title>Required training overdue</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>{{#isManager}}{{personName}} has overdue required training.{{/isManager}}{{^isManager}}Open each course straight from this email.{{/isManager}}</mj-preview>
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body background-color="#F1F5F9" width="600px">
    <mj-include path="./partials/oortcloud-header.mjml" />

    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="18px 32px 30px 32px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text mj-class="h1">{{#isManager}}{{personName}} has overdue training{{/isManager}}{{^isManager}}Your required training is overdue{{/isManager}}</mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          {{#isManager}}Hello {{managerName}}, {{personName}}'s required training below is overdue. You're getting this because you're their manager{{#forTenant}} or their organisation's administrator{{/forTenant}}.{{/isManager}}{{^isManager}}Hello {{personName}}, the required training below is overdue. It's required for your role: {{reason}}{{/isManager}}
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text padding="4px 0 18px 0">
          <table class="em-details" role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
            {{#courses}}
            <tr><td class="v" style="font-weight:400;">
              <strong>{{#url}}<a href="{{url}}">{{title}}</a>{{/url}}{{^url}}{{title}}{{/url}}</strong><br />
              <span style="color:#64748B;">Was due {{dueOn}}{{#lessons}} · {{lessons}} lessons{{/lessons}}</span>
            </td></tr>
            {{/courses}}
          </table>
        </mj-text>

        <mj-raw>{{^isManager}}</mj-raw>
        <mj-text mj-class="h2">What to do</mj-text>
        <mj-text>Open each course above and work through it in the Oortcloud Academy. Your progress is saved as you go, so you can stop and come back.</mj-text>
        <mj-raw>{{#academyUrl}}</mj-raw>
        <mj-button href="{{academyUrl}}">Open the Academy</mj-button>
        <mj-raw>{{/academyUrl}}</mj-raw>
        <mj-raw>{{/isManager}}</mj-raw>
        <mj-raw>{{#isManager}}</mj-raw>
        <mj-text mj-class="h2">What to do</mj-text>
        <mj-text>Please make time for {{personName}} to finish it. Nothing else is needed from you.</mj-text>
        <mj-raw>{{/isManager}}</mj-raw>

        <mj-text mj-class="h2">What happens next</mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          Reminders go out every week until it's done{{^isManager}}, and your manager gets a copy{{/isManager}}. Overdue training never blocks anyone's access.
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text padding="8px 0 0 0">
          <table class="em-help" role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
            <tr><td>
              <strong style="color:#1B2A4A;">Questions about the training?</strong><br />
              Email <a href="mailto:{{trainingContact}}">{{trainingContact}}</a>.
            </td></tr>
          </table>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-include path="./partials/oortcloud-footer.mjml" />
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
